	(descr "Shou Han PJ-327A 5JJ, 3.5mm stereo (TRS) jack with tip and ring break contacts (normalling), horizontal, SMD, body 11.85 x 6 x 4.6mm + Ø5 x 2.3 bushing, 5 feet, 2 locating pegs Ø1.0 (6.0 apart). Drawn from the Shou Han drawing (2020-06-24, LCSC C668605 datasheet); foot positions taken from the EasyEDA STEP (spacings 3.7/6.0 right column, 7.0 left column match the sheet), pads 2 x 3 per sheet, columns ±3.4. Origin = body centre (excl. bushing), bushing points -X. Pins: 1=S 3=R 5=RN 4=T 2=TN (T deepest per schematic). JLCPCB C668605, Economic and Standard.")
